:"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m002-0219","start":219,"end":220,"surface":"談","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m002-0221","start":221,"end":224,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p003","text":"太史公學天官於唐都，受易於楊何，習道論於黃子。太史公仕於建元元封之閒，愍學者之不達其意而師悖，乃論六家之要指曰：\n《易大傳》：「天下一致而百慮，同歸而殊涂。」夫陰陽、儒、墨、名、法、道德，此務為治者也，直所從言之異路，有省不省耳。嘗竊觀陰陽之術，大祥而眾忌諱，使人拘而多所畏；然其序四時之大順，不可失也。儒者博而寡要，勞而少功，是以其事難盡從；然其序君臣父子之禮，列夫婦長幼之別，不可易也。墨者儉而難遵，是以其事不可遍循；然其彊本節用，不可廢也。法家嚴而少恩；然其正君臣上下之分，不可改矣。名家使人儉而善失真；然其正名實，不可不察也。道家使人精神專一，動合無形，贍足萬物。其為術也，因陰陽之大順，采儒墨之善，撮名法之要，與時遷移，應物變化，立俗施事，無所不宜，指約而易操，事少而功多。儒者則不然。以為人主天下之儀表也，主倡而臣和，主先而臣隨。如此則主勞而臣逸。至於大道之要，去健羨，絀聰明，釋此而任術。夫神大用則竭，形大勞則敝。形神騷動，欲與天地長久，非所聞也。\n夫陰陽四時、八位、十二度、二十四節各有教令，順之者昌，逆之者不死則亡，未必然也，故曰「使人拘而多畏」。夫春生夏長，秋收冬藏，此天道之大經也，弗順則無以為天下綱紀，故曰「四時之大順，不可失也」。\n夫儒者以六藝為法。六藝經傳以千萬數，累世不能通其學，當年不能究其禮，故曰「博而寡要，勞而少功」。若夫列君臣父子之禮，序夫婦長幼之別，雖百家弗能易也。\n墨者亦尚堯舜道，言其德行曰：「堂高三尺，土階三等，茅茨不翦，采椽不刮。食土簋，啜土刑，糲粱之食，藜霍之羹。夏日葛衣，冬日鹿裘。」其送死，桐棺三寸，舉音不盡其哀。教喪禮，必以此為萬民之率。使天下法若此，則尊卑無別也。夫世異時移，事業不必同，故曰「儉而難遵」。要曰彊本節用，則人給家足之道也。此墨子之所長，雖百長弗能廢也。\n法家不別親疏，不殊貴賤，一斷於法，則親親尊尊之恩絕矣。可以行一時之計，而不可長用也，故曰「嚴而少恩」。若尊主卑臣，明分職不得相踰越，雖百家弗能改也。\n名家苛察繳繞，使人不得反其意，專決於名而失人情，故曰「使人儉而善失真」。若夫控名責實，參伍不失，此不可不察也。\n道家無為，又曰無不為，其實易行，其辭難知。其術以虛無為本，以因循為用。無成埶，無常形，故能究萬物之情。不為物先，不為物後，故能為萬物主。有法無法，因時為業；有度無度，因物與合。故曰「聖人不朽，時變是守。虛者道之常也，因者君之綱」也。群臣并至，使各自明也。其實中其聲者謂之端，實不中其聲者謂之窾。窾言不聽，姦乃不生，賢不肖自分，白黑乃形。在所欲用耳，何事不成。乃合大道，混混冥冥。光燿天下，復反無名。凡人所生者神也，所讬者形也。神大用則竭，形大勞則敝，形神離則死。死者不可復生，離者不可復反，故聖人重之。由是觀之，神者生之本也，形者生之具也。不先定其神［形］，而曰「我有以治天下」，何由哉？","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"唐都","kind":"person","person_id":"yt8_m1o_8bl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"楊何","kind":"person","person_id":"8qn_ywz_wcu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"黃子","kind":"person","person_id":"9tx_4t9_4jj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0608","start":608,"end":609,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"0ea_a78_okm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0609","start":609,"end":610,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ab2_pxs_34r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m003-0749","start":749,"end":751,"surface":"墨子","kind":"person","person_id":"ego_jo3_7bf","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p004","text":"太史公既掌天官，不治民。有子曰遷。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m004-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m004-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p006","text":"是歲天子始建漢家之封，而太史公留滯周南，不得與從事，故發憤且卒。而子遷適使反，見父於河洛之閒。太史公執遷手而泣曰：「余先周室之太史也。自上世嘗顯功名於虞夏，典天官事。後世中衰，絕於予乎？汝復為太史，則續吾祖矣。今天子接千歲之統，封泰山，而余不得從行，是命也夫，命也夫！余死，汝必為太史；為太史，無忘吾所欲論著矣。且夫孝始於事親，中於事君，終於立身。揚名於後世，以顯父母，此孝之大者。夫天下稱誦周公，言其能論歌文武之德，宣周邵之風，達太王王季之思慮，爰及公劉，以尊后稷也。幽厲之後，王道缺，禮樂衰，孔子修舊起廢，論詩書，作春秋，則學者至今則之。自獲麟以來四百有餘歲，而諸侯相兼，史記放絕。今漢興，海內一統，明主賢君忠臣死義之士，余為太史而弗論載，廢天下之史文，余甚懼焉，汝其念哉！」遷俯首流涕曰：「小子不敏，請悉論先人所次舊聞，弗敢闕。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"lxl_vec_rli","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"文武","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"周邵","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0216","start":216,"end":218,"surface":"太王","kind":"person","person_id":"ir9_9eu_qx2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"王季","kind":"person","person_id":"65h_6hs_e4y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"wh3_77h_m9d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"ys8_rdi_f0i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0235","start":235,"end":237,"surface":"幽厲","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m006-0340","start":340,"end":341,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p011","text":"太史公曰：「唯唯，否否，不然。余聞之先人曰：『伏羲至純厚，作易八卦。堯舜之盛，尚書載之，禮樂作焉。湯武之隆，詩人歌之。春秋采善貶惡，推三代之德，褒周室，非獨刺譏而已也。』漢興以來，至明天子，獲符瑞，封禪，改正朔，易服色，受命於穆清，澤流罔極，海外殊俗，重譯款塞，請來獻見者，不可勝道。臣下百官力誦聖德，猶不能宣盡其意。且士賢能而不用，有國者之恥；主上明聖而德不布聞，有司之過也。且余嘗掌其官，廢明聖盛德不載，滅功臣世家賢大夫之業不述，墮先人所言，罪莫大焉。余所謂述故事，整齊其世傳，非所謂作也，而君比之於春秋，謬矣。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"先人","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"伏羲","kind":"person","person_id":"0xr_z2z_lne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"0ea_a78_okm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ab2_pxs_34r","status":"contextual_provisional"}